      /* why it matters */
      "rl.sig.apollo-11-lm": "The first crewed landing on the Moon (20 July 1969). Eagle’s descent stage still stands at Tranquility Base with the commemorative plaque on its ladder.",
      "rl.sig.apollo-12-lm": "Apollo 12 landed within walking distance of Surveyor 3, a robot that had been on the Moon since April 1967, and the crew brought parts of it home.",
