      "rl.st.pathfinder.title": "The First Steps on Mars",
      "rl.st.pathfinder.tag": "A small rover, a bouncing lander and a new way to reach Mars",
      "rl.st.pathfinder.lead": "On 4 July 1997 Mars Pathfinder landed in Ares Vallis, an ancient flood channel. It carried Sojourner, the first robotic rover on Mars — 10.6 kg and about 30 cm tall.",
